This project is a simple OTC exchange for Aavegotchi assets. It is built on top of the Aavegotchi ecosystem and allows users to trade Aavegotchis, wearables, and portals in a permissionless and trustless manner.

It uses NextJs 16 and Typescript for the frontend.
The main packages used are: 
* NextJs 16
* Typescript
* TailwindCss
* Wagmi.sh / viem
* Reown AppKit / Wagmi Adapter
* Apollo + Codegen for the graphql client.

The project is hosted on Vercel and the code is open source.